{
    "title": "Atlas Earth - Buy Virtual Land",
    "description": "BUY VIRTUAL LAND & EARN REAL MONEY\r\n\r\nATLAS: Earth is a location-based app where users can buy virtual land that mirrors real-world locations, 900 square feet at a time. Purchase land anywhere near your physical location in the real world and the property is yours to keep and earn virtual rent on that you can turn into real money!\r\n\r\nGET YOUR FIRST REAL ESTATE IN THE METAVERSE FOR FREE\r\nEach parcel of land you own in the game earns you rent per second, every second of the day, every day of the year. Parcels start at just $5, and your first parcel is free.\r\n\r\nEARN RENT & CASH OUT\r\nEarn virtual rent every second from your land and cash out the money straight to your PayPal, Venmo, gift cards, and more when your total earnings reach $5 or more.* Players can also transfer accrued rent into more virtual land currency to keep expanding territory and earning rent!\r\n\r\nBOOST RENT HOURLY\r\nBoost rental income on your virtual land in the metaverse for an hour when you watch an ad. Hourly rent boosts reach up to 30x base rent rates and are free with each ad you watch.\r\n\r\nLEADERBOARDS & LEADER ROLES\r\nShow off your virtual land investing skills to other users! Climb the leaderboards and become Mayor, Governor, or even President, by owning the most virtual landa and real estate in your city, state, or country.\r\n\r\nCOLLECT MERCHANT REWARDS\r\nEarn free Atlas Bucks when you shop with our retail partners in the real world. Connect a VISA or Mastercard credit card through our card-linked rewards portal and earn in-game rewards every time you swipe at our growing list of brick-and-mortar stores.\r\n\r\nNOTES:\r\nAtlas Earth is an idle tycoon business game that offers in-game purchases. Is it most ideally played on smartphones, not tablets.\r\n\r\nA parcel of virtual land in the game is not an NFT, and buying property does not require crypto.\r\n\r\nIn order to play, please agree to our Terms of Service, which can be found here: https://legal.atlasreality.com/content/earth/terms-of-service.html\r\n\r\n*Paying Rent is our way of saying thank you. It is our form of loyalty/cash-back for enjoying our game. Although we avoid such scenarios, Rent is not guaranteed and may change or pause.\r\n\r\nPlease get in touch with us at support@atlasreality.com if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nAtlas Earth requirements for Android Devices:\r\nGPS and location services\r\nStrong internet connection\r\nAndroid 8.0+\r\nRooted devices are not supported\r\n2 GB RAM\r\n1.6GHz+ CPU speed",
    "descriptionHTML": "BUY VIRTUAL LAND &amp; EARN REAL MONEY<br><br>ATLAS: Earth is a location-based app where users can buy virtual land that mirrors real-world locations, 900 square feet at a time. Purchase land anywhere near your physical location in the real world and the property is yours to keep and earn virtual rent on that you can turn into real money!<br><br>GET YOUR FIRST REAL ESTATE IN THE METAVERSE FOR FREE<br>Each parcel of land you own in the game earns you rent per second, every second of the day, every day of the year. Parcels start at just $5, and your first parcel is free.<br><br>EARN RENT &amp; CASH OUT<br>Earn virtual rent every second from your land and cash out the money straight to your PayPal, Venmo, gift cards, and more when your total earnings reach $5 or more.* Players can also transfer accrued rent into more virtual land currency to keep expanding territory and earning rent!<br><br>BOOST RENT HOURLY<br>Boost rental income on your virtual land in the metaverse for an hour when you watch an ad. Hourly rent boosts reach up to 30x base rent rates and are free with each ad you watch.<br><br>LEADERBOARDS &amp; LEADER ROLES<br>Show off your virtual land investing skills to other users! Climb the leaderboards and become Mayor, Governor, or even President, by owning the most virtual landa and real estate in your city, state, or country.<br><br>COLLECT MERCHANT REWARDS<br>Earn free Atlas Bucks when you shop with our retail partners in the real world. Connect a VISA or Mastercard credit card through our card-linked rewards portal and earn in-game rewards every time you swipe at our growing list of brick-and-mortar stores.<br><br>NOTES:<br>Atlas Earth is an idle tycoon business game that offers in-game purchases. Is it most ideally played on smartphones, not tablets.<br><br>A parcel of virtual land in the game is not an NFT, and buying property does not require crypto.<br><br>In order to play, please agree to our Terms of Service, which can be found here: https://legal.atlasreality.com/content/earth/terms-of-service.html<br><br>*Paying Rent is our way of saying thank you. It is our form of loyalty/cash-back for enjoying our game. Although we avoid such scenarios, Rent is not guaranteed and may change or pause.<br><br>Please get in touch with us at support@atlasreality.com if you have any questions.<br><br>Atlas Earth requirements for Android Devices:<br>GPS and location services<br>Strong internet connection<br>Android 8.0+<br>Rooted devices are not supported<br>2 GB RAM<br>1.6GHz+ CPU speed",
